meta {
  name: fleet
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  The fleet roster, per-node replay, node control (stop / gate / spawn) and the hub port check. The hub is opt-in via SPECTRO_HUB_ENABLED (or, the older way, SPECTRO_HUB_PORT on its own); without it the roster answers enabled:false and node routes answer 404.
}
